{"id":"da4d48b529c5f7d2","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gls-logic.md","title":"GLS Logic","display":"df-gls-logic — GLS Logic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gls-logic","aliases":["89-df-gls-logic"],"display":"df-gls-logic — GLS Logic","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-reflection-formula]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gls-logic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gls-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gls-logic — GLS Logic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0d2469f2990d6f49\" href=\"?note=0d2469f2990d6f49\" title=\"89-df-reflection-formula\">89-df-reflection-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>下面的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLS}\">\\(\\mathrm{GLS}\\)</span> 是定理集，由有限次 MP 生成；没有必然化规则。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gls\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLS}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\n\\mathrm{GL}\\cup\\{\\Box A\\to A\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\}\\subseteq X\n\\land\n\\forall A,B\\ ((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gls\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLS}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\n\\mathrm{GL}\\cup\\{\\Box A\\to A\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\}\\subseteq X\n\\land\n\\forall A,B\\ ((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 3 章，印刷页 65–66；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n包含所有 GL 定理和所有反射实例，唯一推理规则为 MP。定义族非空（全部公式集在其中），交集即有限 MP 闭包。加入必然化会使反射与 Löb 共同推出矛盾，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e62e9105378d9d51\" href=\"?note=e62e9105378d9d51\" title=\"89-prop-gls-not-normal\">89-prop-gls-not-normal</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-reflection-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0d2469f2990d6f49","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-reflection-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-prop-gls-not-normal","status":"resolved","id":"e62e9105378d9d51","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"来源：Boolos, *The Logic of Provability*，第 3 章，印刷页 65–66；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n包含所有 GL 定理和所有反射实例，唯一推理规则为 MP。定义族非空（全部公式集在其中），交集即有限 MP 闭包。加入必然化会使反射与 Löb 共同推出矛盾，见 [[89-prop-gls-not-normal]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLS}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gls\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLS}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\n\\mathrm{GL}\\cup\\{\\Box A\\to A\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\}\\subseteq X\n\\land\n\\forall A,B\\ ((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1128,"backlinks":[{"id":"e62e9105378d9d51","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9e926c452321080c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gls-logic]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-61","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation]] → [[89-thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma]] → [[89-thm-lob-internal]] → [[89-thm-lob-theorem]] → [[89-df-reflection-principle]] → [[89-df-gls-logic]]"}],"outgoing":["0006800fa1c85177","0d2469f2990d6f49","e62e9105378d9d51"]}